    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td> \c plot_sol_xi </td><td> plot the plasma displacement \f$\vec{\xi}\f$ \f$\left[m\right]\f$ of the solution and its components \f$  X = \frac{\nabla \psi}{B^2} \cdot \vec{\xi} \f$ \f$\left[\frac{m^2}{T}\right]\f$ and \f$ U = \frac{\nabla \psi \times \vec{B}}{\left|\nabla \psi\right|^2} \cdot \vec{\xi} \f$ \f$\left[\phantom{\cdot}\right]\f$ </td><td> <tt>.true.</tt> </td><td> \c log </td><td> (\ref fni26 "26") </td>
    </tr>
